{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05506","headline":"京中守岁 · 丁仙芝","name":"京中守岁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"守岁多然烛，通宵莫掩扉。\n客愁当暗满，春色向明归。\n玉斗巡初匝，银河落渐微。\n开正献岁酒，千里间庭闱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"丁仙芝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05506.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05506","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}